{% comment %}
  LIFTD compliance block — NON-NEGOTIABLE.
  Rendered from layout/theme.liquid on every page. Not a section, not a
  customizer block: it must never be removable, editable, or reordered from
  the theme editor. Do not move it into a section group.

  Product facts here are the approved, locked wordings only:
    3mg THC + 9mg CBG per 12oz can · Hemp-derived THC · 21+ only · Zero alcohol
  Do not add calories, onset times, or any other number.
  Shipping is never stated without the state-law qualifier.
{% endcomment %}
<aside class="liftd-compliance" aria-label="{{ 'compliance.aria_label' | t }}">
  <div class="liftd-wrapper">
    <ul class="liftd-compliance__facts" role="list">
      <li class="liftd-chip">21+ only</li>
      <li class="liftd-chip">Hemp-derived THC</li>
      <li class="liftd-chip">3mg THC + 9mg CBG per 12oz can</li>
      <li class="liftd-chip">Zero alcohol</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      21+ only. Contains THC. Keep out of reach of children. Do not drive or
      operate machinery after use. Not for use during pregnancy or
      breastfeeding. Start low, go slow.
    </p>
    <p>
      Ships only to states where permitted by law.
    </p>
    <p>
      These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug
      Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure,
      or prevent any disease.
    </p>
    <p>&copy; {{ 'now' | date: '%Y' }} {{ shop.name }}. All rights reserved.</p>
  </div>
</aside>
